{"seq":1,"slug":"pod-security-standards","title":"Pod Security Standards 安全基线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/pod-security-standards","wordCount":909,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"pod-security-standards-安全基线\">Pod Security Standards 安全基线</h1><p>Kubernetes 1.25 正式移除了已弃用的 PodSecurityPolicy（PSP），取而代之的是内置的 Pod Security Admission（PSA）控制器配合 Pod Security Standards（PSS）。PSS 定义了三个递进的安全等级——privileged（不限制）、baseline（防止已知提权）、restricted（全面加固最佳实践）——通过简单的 namespace 标签即可启用，无需安装任何第三方组件。对于没有专职安全团队的组织，PSS restricted 是成本最低的全集群安全基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Pod Security Standards 的三级安全模型与实施方式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Pod 创建请求] --&gt; B[API Server]&#10;    B --&gt; C[PSA 准入控制器]&#10;    C --&gt; D{检查 namespace 标签}&#10;    D --&gt; E[enforce: 拒绝违规 Pod]&#10;    D --&gt; F[warn: 允许但发出警告]&#10;    D --&gt; G[audit: 允许但记录审计日志]&#10;&#10;    H[privileged] --&gt; I[无限制 - 系统组件用]&#10;    J[baseline] --&gt; K[阻止已知提权路径]&#10;    L[restricted] --&gt; M[全面加固最佳实践]&#10;&#10;    K --&gt; K1[禁止特权容器]&#10;    K --&gt; K2[禁止 hostNetwork/PID/IPC]&#10;    K --&gt; K3[禁止 hostPath 挂载]&#10;    M --&gt; M1[必须 runAsNonRoot]&#10;    M --&gt; M2[必须 drop ALL capabilities]&#10;    M --&gt; M3[必须 Seccomp RuntimeDefault]&#10;    M --&gt; M4[禁止 privilege escalation]\">graph TD\n    A[Pod 创建请求] --&gt; B[API Server]\n    B --&gt; C[PSA 准入控制器]\n    C --&gt; D{检查 namespace 标签}\n    D --&gt; E[enforce: 拒绝违规 Pod]\n    D --&gt; F[warn: 允许但发出警告]\n    D --&gt; G[audit: 允许但记录审计日志]\n\n    H[privileged] --&gt; I[无限制 - 系统组件用]\n    J[baseline] --&gt; K[阻止已知提权路径]\n    L[restricted] --&gt; M[全面加固最佳实践]\n\n    K --&gt; K1[禁止特权容器]\n    K --&gt; K2[禁止 hostNetwork/PID/IPC]\n    K --&gt; K3[禁止 hostPath 挂载]\n    M --&gt; M1[必须 runAsNonRoot]\n    M --&gt; M2[必须 drop ALL capabilities]\n    M --&gt; M3[必须 Seccomp RuntimeDefault]\n    M --&gt; M4[禁止 privilege escalation]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PSS 级别</th>\n<th>禁止的配置</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>对应旧 PSP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>privileged</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>kube-system、监控代理</td>\n<td>无约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>baseline</td>\n<td>特权容器、hostNamespace、hostPath、hostPort</td>\n<td>大部分应用工作负载</td>\n<td>中等限制 PSP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>restricted</td>\n<td>上述 + root 运行 + 非默认 seccomp + 额外 capabilities</td>\n<td>安全敏感应用</td>\n<td>严格 PSP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"启用-pss-的三种模式\">启用 PSS 的三种模式</h2><p>PSA 通过 namespace 标签控制，支持三种独立的执行模式，可以任意组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 为 production namespace 启用 restricted 级别（强制执行）&#10;kubectl label namespace production \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=restricted \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn=restricted \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit=restricted&#10;&#10;# 为 staging namespace 用 warn 模式试运行&#10;kubectl label namespace staging \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=baseline \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn=restricted \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit=restricted&#10;&#10;# kube-system 使用 baseline（系统组件需要部分特权）&#10;kubectl label namespace kube-system \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=baseline \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn=restricted \\&#10;  pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit=restricted\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 为 production namespace 启用 restricted 级别（强制执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=restricted</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn=restricted</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit=restricted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 为 staging namespace 用 warn 模式试运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> staging</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=baseline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn=restricted</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit=restricted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># kube-system 使用 baseline（系统组件需要部分特权）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> kube-system</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=baseline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/warn=restricted</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  pod-security.kubernetes.io/audit=restricted</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>enforce</strong>：违规 Pod 直接被拒绝创建，API 返回错误。</p>\n<p><strong>warn</strong>：Pod 正常创建，但 kubectl 输出中会显示黄色警告消息，提示哪些字段违规。</p>\n<p><strong>audit</strong>：Pod 正常创建，违规信息记录到 Kubernetes 审计日志中，可被 SIEM 收集分析。</p>\n<p>推荐的迁移策略：先用 audit + warn 发现所有违规工作负载 → 逐一修复 → 最后启用 enforce。</p>\n<h2 id=\"restricted-级别的完整要求\">restricted 级别的完整要求</h2><p><code>restricted</code> 级别是生产环境的推荐目标，它要求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Pod&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: restricted-compliant&#10;spec:&#10;  securityContext:&#10;    runAsNonRoot: true&#10;    seccompProfile:&#10;      type: RuntimeDefault&#10;  containers:&#10;    - name: app&#10;      image: myapp:v1.0&#10;      securityContext:&#10;        allowPrivilegeEscalation: false&#10;        runAsNonRoot: true&#10;        readOnlyRootFilesystem: true&#10;        capabilities:&#10;          drop: [&#39;ALL&#39;]&#10;        seccompProfile:&#10;          type: RuntimeDefault&#10;      resources:&#10;        limits:&#10;          memory: &#39;256Mi&#39;&#10;          cpu: &#39;500m&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">restricted-compliant</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  securityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runAsNonRoot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    seccompProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RuntimeDefault</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp:v1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      securityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        allowPrivilegeEscalation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        runAsNonRoot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        readOnlyRootFilesystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          drop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ALL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        seccompProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RuntimeDefault</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'256Mi'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'500m'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常见违规修复</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>runAsNonRoot: true</code> 失败 → Dockerfile 中添加 <code>USER nonroot</code> 并确保应用不依赖 root 权限</li>\n<li><code>readOnlyRootFilesystem</code> 导致应用写入失败 → 为需要写入的路径（<code>/tmp</code>、日志目录）挂载 emptyDir volume</li>\n<li><code>drop ALL capabilities</code> 导致绑定端口失败 → 改用 &gt;1024 端口，或显式 add <code>NET_BIND_SERVICE</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pss-未覆盖的场景\">PSS 未覆盖的场景</h2><p>PSS 提供了重要的基线，但设计上有意保持简单，不覆盖以下场景（需要 Kyverno/Gatekeeper 补充）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>镜像仓库白名单</strong>：PSS 不限制镜像来源，任何注册表的镜像都可以部署</li>\n<li><strong>latest tag 禁止</strong>：PSS 不检查镜像 tag 策略</li>\n<li><strong>资源限制强制</strong>：PSS 不要求声明 resources.limits</li>\n<li><strong>标签/注解要求</strong>：PSS 不强制业务标签</li>\n<li><strong>镜像签名验证</strong>：PSS 不验证 Cosign 签名</li>\n<li><strong>自定义组织策略</strong>：任何组织特有的安全约束</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"集群级默认配置\">集群级默认配置</h2><p>除了 namespace 标签，PSA 还支持集群级别的默认配置（通过 AdmissionConfiguration）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# /etc/kubernetes/psa-config.yaml&#10;apiVersion: apiserver.config.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: AdmissionConfiguration&#10;plugins:&#10;  - name: PodSecurity&#10;    configuration:&#10;      apiVersion: pod-security.admission.config.k8s.io/v1&#10;      kind: PodSecurityConfiguration&#10;      defaults:&#10;        enforce: &#39;baseline&#39;&#10;        warn: &#39;restricted&#39;&#10;        audit: &#39;restricted&#39;&#10;      exemptions:&#10;        usernames: []&#10;        runtimeClasses: []&#10;        namespaces: [&#39;kube-system&#39;, &#39;kube-public&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># /etc/kubernetes/psa-config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apiserver.config.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">AdmissionConfiguration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plugins</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PodSecurity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    configuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pod-security.admission.config.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PodSecurityConfiguration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      defaults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        enforce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'baseline'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'restricted'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'restricted'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exemptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        usernames</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        runtimeClasses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        namespaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kube-system'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kube-public'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这确保即使新创建的 namespace 未被标签，也会自动应用至少 baseline 级别的保护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-psp-迁移的实践路径\">从 PSP 迁移的实践路径</h2><p>对于仍在使用 PodSecurityPolicy 的集群（Kubernetes 1.25 之前），迁移步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>审计现状</strong>：列出所有现有 PSP 及其绑定的 namespace/ServiceAccount</li>\n<li><strong>映射到 PSS 级别</strong>：将每个 PSP 的约束映射到 privileged/baseline/restricted</li>\n<li><strong>并行运行</strong>：在 PSP 仍然生效的同时，为每个 namespace 添加对应级别的 PSA 标签（warn/audit 模式）</li>\n<li><strong>验证无违规</strong>：确认审计日志中不再有新的违规记录</li>\n<li><strong>切换到 enforce</strong>：升级 PSA 到 enforce 模式</li>\n<li><strong>移除 PSP</strong>：删除所有 PodSecurityPolicy 资源</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PSS 三个级别（privileged/baseline/restricted）覆盖从无约束到全面加固的安全梯度</li>\n<li>通过 namespace 标签即可启用，内置于 Kubernetes，无需额外组件</li>\n<li>enforce/warn/audit 三种模式支持渐进式迁移而非一步切换</li>\n<li>restricted 级别是生产环境推荐的最低安全基线</li>\n<li>PSS 有意保持简单，需 Kyverno/Gatekeeper 补充自定义策略</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"admission-control-kyverno\">准入控制与 Kyverno</a>——PSS 之上如何实现更精细的自定义安全策略</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/configmaps-and-secrets\">Kubernetes ConfigMaps 与 Secrets</a>——理解 PSS 保护的 Secret 管理基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Pod Security Standards 安全基线","id":"pod-security-standards-安全基线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"启用 PSS 的三种模式","id":"启用-pss-的三种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"restricted 级别的完整要求","id":"restricted-级别的完整要求"},{"level":2,"text":"PSS 未覆盖的场景","id":"pss-未覆盖的场景"},{"level":2,"text":"集群级默认配置","id":"集群级默认配置"},{"level":2,"text":"从 PSP 迁移的实践路径","id":"从-psp-迁移的实践路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"eBPF 安全可观测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/ebpf-observability"},"next":{"title":"准入控制与 Kyverno","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/orchestration/admission-control-kyverno"}}